flowchart TD
    QUERY([Incoming messages]) --> CLASSIFY{Classify complexity}

    CLASSIFY -- fewer than 20 tokens\nor greeting/confirmation --> FAST[Tier: fast]
    CLASSIFY -- multi-step / analysis\n/ synthesis --> REASONING[Tier: reasoning]

    FAST --> FILTER_FAST[Filter _MODEL_REGISTRY by tier=fast\nSort by priority, then health]
    REASONING --> FILTER_REASON[Filter _MODEL_REGISTRY by tier=reasoning\nSort by priority, then health]

    FILTER_FAST --> CHAIN[Build fallback chain max 3 models]
    FILTER_REASON --> CHAIN

    CHAIN --> TRY1[Attempt model 1\nvia LiteLLM async stream]
    TRY1 -- success --> STREAM_TOKENS([Stream tokens back])
    TRY1 -- error or timeout 5s --> TRY2[Attempt model 2]
    TRY2 -- success --> STREAM_TOKENS
    TRY2 -- error or timeout --> TRY3[Attempt model 3]
    TRY3 -- success --> STREAM_TOKENS
    TRY3 -- all failed --> ERROR_RESP([Return error — no free model available])